{
  "name": "official-sources-v1",
  "_comment": [
    "The deployed collection profile. Edit through review, not on the host:",
    "the manifest records this fingerprint, so a later replay can tell",
    "'this feed was not configured yet' from 'this feed returned nothing'.",
    "Feeds are ids from market_intelligence/collection/feeds.py -- adding a",
    "source is a code change, deliberately.",
    "user_agent carries the shape, never the address: set BTC_INTEL_CONTACT on",
    "the host to an address a publisher can write to. The SEC answers 403 to a",
    "collector it cannot contact, and a repository is the wrong place to",
    "publish somebody's email.",
    "sec-litigation and treasury-press were removed on 2026-09-03: both 404.",
    "See RETIRED_FEED_IDS in feeds.py.",
    "sec-admin-proceedings added 2026-09-03 as its own identity, NOT as a",
    "replacement for the retired sec-litigation: administrative proceedings and",
    "civil litigation releases are different instruments."
  ],
  "user_agent": "BTC-Forecaster Research <${BTC_INTEL_CONTACT}>",
  "minimum_interval_seconds": 900,
  "timeout_seconds": 20.0,
  "max_attempts": 3,
  "feeds": [
    "sec-press",
    "sec-admin-proceedings",
    "federalreserve-press",
    "federalreserve-monetary",
    "cftc-press",
    "bls-news"
  ],
  "watchlist": [
    {
      "canonical_name": "SEC",
      "aliases": [
        "Securities and Exchange Commission"
      ],
      "entity_type": "REGULATOR",
      "topics": [
        "bitcoin regulation",
        "crypto enforcement",
        "ETF approval"
      ],
      "expected_event_types": [
        "REGULATION",
        "ETF_FLOW"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_name": "Federal Reserve",
      "aliases": [
        "Powell",
        "Jerome Powell",
        "FOMC"
      ],
      "entity_type": "CENTRAL_BANK",
      "topics": [
        "monetary policy",
        "interest rates",
        "FOMC statement"
      ],
      "expected_event_types": [
        "MONETARY_POLICY",
        "MACRO_SHOCK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_name": "CFTC",
      "aliases": [
        "Commodity Futures Trading Commission"
      ],
      "entity_type": "REGULATOR",
      "topics": [
        "digital asset enforcement",
        "derivatives"
      ],
      "expected_event_types": [
        "REGULATION"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_name": "US Treasury",
      "aliases": [
        "Department of the Treasury",
        "OFAC"
      ],
      "entity_type": "REGULATOR",
      "topics": [
        "sanctions",
        "digital asset policy"
      ],
      "expected_event_types": [
        "REGULATION",
        "GEOPOLITICAL_EVENT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_name": "Bureau of Labor Statistics",
      "aliases": [
        "BLS"
      ],
      "entity_type": "INSTITUTION",
      "topics": [
        "CPI",
        "employment situation",
        "inflation"
      ],
      "expected_event_types": [
        "MACRO_SHOCK"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
